  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "HOME HIGHLIGHTS:<br>- Lakefront property on Eastern Lake<br>- Gulf views<br>- Shared dock<br>- 1.5 Miles from Seaside<br>- Private heated pool and swim spa *Pool heating is available for $40/day October 1-May 1<br>- 5 adult bikes<br>- Grill<br>- EV Charging <br>- Complete Clean Linen Participant - All linens, including comforter covers, are laundered upon every checkout<br><br>DETAILS: Savor a dreamy 30A getaway at Sunset Serenity in Seagrove Beach. Hosting up to 18 guests, this beautiful 5-bedroom, 6.5-bathroom lakefront home offers all the slow-paced charm of Seagrove. Enjoy paddleboarding or kayaking on Eastern Lake and strolling to the beach—only 3 minutes away—for sunbathing and seashell hunting. With a private heated pool, sitting spa, and sprawling lake views, guests have everything needed for a luxurious and leisurely escape.<br><br>Crafted for contemporary coastal living, the first-level great room features woven accents, shiplap detailing, and tile flooring—all in soothing shades of white and gray to reflect the warm sunlight. The fully equipped kitchen boasts high-end appliances and ample counter space, including a 4-stool breakfast bar for quiet mornings gathered over coffee. Savor home-cooked meals together at the 2 spacious dining tables, collectively seating 16. The living space’s matching slip-covered loveseats and plush armchair frame a Smart TV for convenient entertainment. On the sheltered patio, relax in the soft breeze of the overhead fan and take in the lake view at the 6-person table. A few steps lead down to the pool area, complete with a grill and outdoor shower. Recline on the cushioned loungers, take a refreshing swim, or soak in the sitting spa. A guest bedroom with 2 queen beds and a private bathroom offers cozy accommodations, alongside a queen sleeper sofa in the living space.<br><br>On the second level, find 2 primary bedrooms, each with a king bed, private bathroom, and shared balcony, as well as 1 guest bedroom with 2 queen beds and 1 bunk room with 1 full-over-full bed and 1 full trundle.<br><br>Relax with loved ones in the top-level lounge space, featuring stunning lake views, an enormous sectional, 2 couches, a 4-seat table, and a Smart TV. A convenient kitchenette boasting a beverage fridge makes it easy to grab a drink to sip on the balcony’s Adirondack chairs. For additional accommodations, there is a queen Murphy bed in the lounge.<br><br>A carefree Seagrove Beach escape awaits at Sunset Serenity. Effortlessly explore with parking for 3 vehicles, or cruise the Timpoochee Trail on the 5 provided adult bikes. Beach access is a 3-minute stroll away, at the end of Beachside Drive. Book today!<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS: (SLEEPS 18):<br>FIRST FLOOR:<br>- Guest Bedroom: 2 Queen Beds, Private Bathroom with Shower Only<br>- Additional Sleeping Area: Queen Sleeper Sofa<br><br>SECOND FLOOR:<br>- Primary Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower Only<br>- Primary Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower/Jacuzzi Tub<br>- Guest Bedroom: 2 Queen Beds, Private Bathroom with Shower/Tub Combo<br>- Guest Bedroom: Full-over-Full Bunk Bed and Full Trundle, Shared Bathroom with Shower Only<br><br>THIRD FLOOR:<br>- Additional Living Area: Queen Murphy Bed, Shared Bathroom with Shower Only<br><br>* The boat lift is not for guest use.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Lakefront! Gulf Views! Private Pool! Grill! Bikes! EV Charger!"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
